@# One-shot events used to exercise automatic home-entry selection.

:: home.random.forgotten-mug
  @place-key player_home
  @auto enter-place
  @when not story.homeEvents.forgottenMugPlayed
@heading "An abandoned mug"

@onenter
  @effect set story.homeEvents.forgottenMugPlayed true
@endonenter

A half-finished mug of tea waits on the kitchen counter. It has gone completely cold, and you cannot remember leaving it there.

@choice next "Next" -> @exit
@endchoice

:: home.random.open-window
  @place-key player_home
  @auto enter-place
  @when not story.homeEvents.openWindowPlayed
@heading "An open window"

@onenter
  @effect set story.homeEvents.openWindowPlayed true
@endonenter

One of the windows is cracked open. A faint breeze stirs the curtains and carries the distant noise of the street through the room.

@choice next "Next" -> @exit
@endchoice

:: home.random.late-breakfast
  @place-key player_home
  @auto enter-place
  @when not story.homeEvents.lateBreakfastPlayed
  @when time.minutesSinceMidnight >= 600
  @when time.minutesSinceMidnight <= 780
@heading "The remains of breakfast"

@onenter
  @effect set story.homeEvents.lateBreakfastPlayed true
@endonenter

The kitchen still smells faintly of toast. A few crumbs remain on the table, catching the late-morning light.

@choice next "Next" -> @exit
@endchoice
